# Spotlight Card

A collection of card components with dynamic mouse-tracking lighting effects (beams, gradients, glows, and tilts).

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/spotlight-card.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/spotlight-card.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/spotlight-card.json
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { 
  SpotlightCard, 
  SpotlightCardHeader, 
  SpotlightCardTitle, 
  SpotlightCardContent 
} from '@/registry/spotlight-card'
</script>

<template>
  <SpotlightCard>
    <SpotlightCardHeader>
      <SpotlightCardTitle>Spotlight Effect</SpotlightCardTitle>
    </SpotlightCardHeader>
    <SpotlightCardContent>
      Move your mouse over this card to see the effect.
    </SpotlightCardContent>
  </SpotlightCard>
</template>
```

