### Variants

- `SpotlightCard`: Standard glow effect.
- `SpotlightCardBeam`: Cross-beam light effect.
- `SpotlightCardGradient`: Multi-color gradient follow.
- `SpotlightCardMultiple`: Multiple colored light sources.
- `SpotlightCardTilt`: 3D tilt effect combined with lighting.

### Props (Standard SpotlightCard)

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `spotlightColor` | `string` | `'rgba(120, 119, 198, 0.3)'` | The color of the spotlight effect. |
| `borderColor` | `string` | `undefined` | Custom gradient/color for the border. |
| `borderWidth` | `number` | `1` | Border width in pixels. |
| `borderRadius` | `number` | `16` | Corner radius in pixels. |
| `glowIntensity` | `number` | `0.15` | Brightness of the spotlight glow. |
| `class` | `string` | `undefined` | Additional CSS classes. |

### Props (Tilt Variant)

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `maxTilt` | `number` | `10` | Maximum tilt angle in degrees. |
| `perspective` | `number` | `1000` | 3D perspective distance. |
| `scale` | `number` | `1.02` | Hover scale factor. |
| `glareOpacity` | `number` | `0.2` | Intensity of the reflective glare. |
